        "created_at": "2015-01-27T18:03:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Was looking at the picture of the Wagner Mars base in the store. Absolute Zero is going to be fun in here with his ice hazards. (cant remember the card name that brings them out). Depending on what is going on just run around and put them into key hallways that are single hexes and force the other team to have to walk through 2 or 3 spaces of ice and take damage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>speaking of which does anyone know what the maps will be made out of that are being sold individually? are they going to be actually game board tiles like they were in the core game or is it going to be something else</p>",
