        "id": 129555,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-27T19:27:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When I used to get some higher quality maps for Battletech I went and bought a shipping tube that would hold them, and that kept them safe. &nbsp;It was kind of big and heavy, but it kept them in great shape. &nbsp;It won't be convenient for carrying around, but it shouldn't be too bad.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It will be fun to have maps that totally revalue different abilities by their size and setup. &nbsp;Wraith and Bunker might not be the most fond of those close quarters, but AZ and Proletariat are going to love it.</p><p>Also Turret Bot and Tornado, that will be sick.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:04:30.986Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
